# SHA-256 of each published `arc-ghc` reference binary, by platform.
#
# These pin the artifacts served from the `reference-9a127e6` release. They are
# integrity pins for a DOWNLOAD, not a claim that the build is reproducible --
# it is not. Two builds of 9a127e6 differ by SHA and produce identical
# archives, so a locally built binary is equally valid and is NOT checked
# against this file. See haskell-reference.sh.
#
# A platform with no line here refuses to download rather than accepting
# whatever arrives.
#
# platform         sha256
darwin-arm64       ccf84e7e8a8b4561e0f37d7d9beb1fe2c6854b9d1acbbb3075c0624215af97a7
linux-x86_64       ac4b1f4a95e89bef3c14a3fa2c6f319cb5413acde44ec01a8ee397535e2b6b78
linux-aarch64      a35a8546225f068c0e8446a81e5b107d922ff1ff590289d4541ddec89513a445
